01:48:02,240 --> 01:48:09,640
Okay? Alright. Now, why go and make a big deal about the price of irrationality when the price is free?

103
01:48:09,640 --> 01:48:16,240
I guess I already erased it, but remember we talked about what is the probability of voter decisiveness in most real important elections?

104
01:48:16,240 --> 01:48:23,640
Roughly. Zero. Alright. So suppose that you believe something insane and you vote on the basis of your insanity.

105
01:48:23,640 --> 01:48:28,240
