109
01:48:44,640 --> 01:48:49,640
Right? And that is what's very special about democracy.

110
01:48:49,640 --> 01:48:56,640
Democracy essentially goes and fixes the price of irrational beliefs all the way down at zero.

111
01:48:56,640 --> 01:49:02,640
